I</span> <span begin="22.685" end="23.066">call</span> <span begin="23.371" end="23.550">your</span> <span begin="23.550" end="24.219">name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻声呼唤你的名字</span></p><p begin="24.917" end="27.275" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.917" end="25.090">Can</span> <span begin="25.090" end="25.273">you</span> <span begin="25.273" end="25.789">hear</span> <span begin="25.789" end="25.974">my</span> <span begin="25.974" end="26.337">lit</span><span begin="26.337" end="26.499">tle</span> <span begin="26.499" end="27.275">voice?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听见呢？</span></p><p begin="28.069" end="29.838" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.069" end="28.250">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="28.250" end="28.651">all</span> <span begin="29.099" end="29.281">a</span><span begin="29.281" end="29.838">lone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是孤身一人</span></p><p begin="30.491" end="32.946" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.491" end="30.682">Can</span> <span begin="30.682" end="30.847">I</span> <span begin="30.847" end="31.025">i</span><span begin="31.025" end="31.326">ma</span><span begin="31.326" end="31.536">gine</span> <span begin="31.536" end="31.819">that</span> <span begin="31.819" end="31.915">you</span><span begin="31.915" end="32.071">&apos;re</span> <span begin="32.071" end="32.946">close?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能否设想你已在身旁呢？</span></p><p begin="33.311" end="35.337" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.311" end="33.854">I</span> <span begin="33.854" end="34.247">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="34.698" end="34.872">des</span><span begin="34.872" end="35.337">cribe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难以言表的</span></p><p begin="36.263" end="38.226" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.263" end="36.446">What</span> <span begin="36.446" end="36.620">this</span> <span begin="36.620" end="36.962">feel</span><span begin="36.962" end="37.154">ing</span> <span begin="37.154" end="37.496">is</span> <span begin="37.496" end="37.666">in</span><span begin="37.666" end="38.226">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份位于心中的情感</span></p><p begin="39.143" end="41.142" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.143" end="39.417">So</span> <span begin="39.417" end="39.960">far</span> <span begin="40.088" end="40.453">a</span><span begin="40.453" end="41.142">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遥于天边</span></p><p begin="41.795" end="44.031" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.795" end="42.037">But</span> <span begin="42.037" end="42.210">I</span> <span begin="42.210" end="42.484">want</span> <span begin="42.484" end="42.698">you</span> <span begin="42.698" end="43.073">by</span> <span begin="43.073" end="43.182">my</span> <span begin="43.182" end="44.031">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我仍期望你能伴我身旁</span></p><p begin="44.483" end="47.070" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.483" end="44.825">When</span> <span begin="44.825" end="44.989">the</span> <span begin="44.989" end="45.400">days</span> <span begin="45.400" end="46.030">feel</span> <span begin="46.030" end="47.070">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当日常已觉漫长</span></p><p begin="47.422" end="49.772" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.422" end="47.604">And</span> <span begin="47.604" end="47.783">I</span> <span begin="47.783" end="48.303">close</span> <span begin="48.303" end="48.818">my</span> <span begin="48.818" end="49.772">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是闭上了双眼</span></p><p begin="50.192" end="54.875" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.192" end="50.379">I</span> <span begin="50.379" end="50.557">can</span> <span begin="50.557" end="51.264">dream</span> <span begin="51.264" end="51.437">you</span><span begin="51.437" end="51.607">&apos;re</span> <span begin="51.607" end="52.309">by</span> <span begin="52.309" end="52.994">my</span> <span begin="52.994" end="54.875">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能在梦中与你相会啦</span></p><p begin="1:18.482" end="1:20.440" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.482" end="1:18.829">Fly</span> <span begin="1:18.829" end="1:19.189">high</span> <span begin="1:19.189" end="1:19.236">o</span><span begin="1:19.236" end="1:19.377">ver</span> <span begin="1:19.377" end="1:19.751">the</span> <span begin="1:19.751" end="1:20.440">moon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随心飞往那比月亮更高之处</span></p><p begin="1:20.741" end="1:23.370" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.741" end="1:20.915">So</span> <span begin="1:20.915" end="1:21.065">we</span> <span begin="1:21.065" end="1:21.216">can</span> <span begin="1:21.216" end="1:21.645">see</span> <span begin="1:21.645" end="1:21.786">a</span> <span begin="1:21.786" end="1:21.969">brand</span> <span begin="1:21.969" end="1:22.329">new</span> <span begin="1:22.329" end="1:23.370">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是崭新的世界屹立于我们眼前啦</span></p><p begin="1:24.068" end="1:26.053" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.068" end="1:24.428">Step</span> <span begin="1:24.428" end="1:24.766">step</span> <span begin="1:24.766" end="1:24.967">walk</span><span begin="1:24.967" end="1:25.105">ing</span> <span begin="1:25.105" end="1:25.282">with</span> <span begin="1:25.282" end="1:26.053">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一步，两步，携手与你前行</span></p><p begin="1:26.332" end="1:28.978" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.332" end="1:26.487">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:26.487" end="1:26.665">be</span> <span begin="1:26.665" end="1:26.852">to</span><span begin="1:26.852" end="1:27.190">ge</span><span begin="1:27.190" end="1:27.372">ther</span> <span begin="1:27.372" end="1:27.546">for</span><span begin="1:27.546" end="1:27.719">e</span><span begin="1:27.719" end="1:28.978">ver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们永远如此吧</span></p><p begin="1:29.645" end="1:31.717" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.645" end="1:29.987">Shine</span> <span begin="1:29.987" end="1:30.320">shine</span> <span begin="1:30.320" end="1:30.521">un</span><span begin="1:30.521" end="1:30.736">der</span> <span begin="1:30.736" end="1:30.859">the</span> <span begin="1:30.859" end="1:31.717">stars</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪耀，璀璨，于漫漫星辰下</span></p><p begin="1:31.913" end="1:34.510" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.913" end="1:32.091">I</span><span begin="1:32.091" end="1:32.287">llu</span><span begin="1:32.287" end="1:32.439">mi</span><span begin="1:32.439" end="1:32.798">nate</span> <span begin="1:32.798" end="1:32.963">the</span> <span begin="1:32.963" end="1:33.145">dark</span><span begin="1:33.145" end="1:33.477">est</span> <span begin="1:33.477" end="1:34.510">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连那极夜都能照亮</span></p><p begin="1:35.212" end="1:37.312" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.212" end="1:35.550">Though</span> <span begin="1:35.550" end="1:35.902">I</span> <span begin="1:35.902" end="1:36.084">can</span> <span begin="1:36.084" end="1:36.358">only</span> <span begin="1:36.358" end="1:37.312">stay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管我依旧只能</span></p><p begin="1:37.494" end="1:41.497" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.494" end="1:37.681">I</span><span begin="1:37.681" end="1:37.846">ma</span><span begin="1:37.846" end="1:38.028">gin</span><span begin="1:38.028" end="1:38.215">ing</span> <span begin="1:38.215" end="1:38.352">you</span><span begin="1:38.352" end="1:38.558">&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:38.558" end="1:38.891">by</span> <span begin="1:38.891" end="1:38.973">my</span> <span begin="1:38.973" end="1:41.497">side</