<span begin="2:11.305" end="2:11.492">I</span> <span begin="2:11.492" end="2:11.820">want</span> <span begin="2:11.820" end="2:12.012">you</span> <span begin="2:12.012" end="2:12.350">by</span> <span begin="2:12.350" end="2:12.523">my</span> <span begin="2:12.523" end="2:13.627">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但仍想于你身旁</span></p><p begin="2:13.947" end="2:16.808" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.947" end="2:14.111">When</span> <span begin="2:14.111" end="2:14.289">the</span> <span begin="2:14.289" end="2:14.823">days</span> <span begin="2:14.823" end="2:15.348">feel</span> <span begin="2:15.348" end="2:16.808">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当独自一人的日子已觉漫长</span></p><p begin="2:16.726" end="2:19.181" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.726" end="2:16.900">And</span> <span begin="2:16.900" end="2:17.046">I</span> <span begin="2:17.046" end="2:17.602">close</span> <span begin="2:17.602" end="2:17.876">my</span> <span begin="2:17.876" end="2:19.181">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不妨闭上双眼</span></p><p begin="2:19.537" end="2:25.265" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.537" end="2:19.738">I</span> <span begin="2:19.738" end="2:19.879">can</span> <span begin="2:19.879" end="2:20.436">dream</span> <span begin="2:20.436" end="2:20.569">you</span><span begin="2:20.569" end="2:20.893">&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:20.893" end="2:21.678">by</span> <span begin="2:21.678" end="2:22.079">my</span> <span begin="2:22.079" end="2:25.265">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦寐以求的相会已于梦中</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:22.684" end="2:25.030"><span begin="2:22.684" end="2:22.944">(pam</span> <span begin="2:23.378" end="2:23.661">pam</span> <span begin="2:24.072" end="2:24.364">pam</span> <span begin="2:24.779" end="2:25.030">pam)</span></span></p><p begin="2:47.786" end="2:49.890" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.786" end="2:48.129">Fly</span> <span begin="2:48.129" end="2:48.473">high</span> <span begin="2:48.473" end="2:48.541">o</span><span begin="2:48.541" end="2:48.664">ver</span> <span begin="2:48.664" end="2:48.994">the</span> <span begin="2:48.994" end="2:49.890">moon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遥于月亮</span></p><p begin="2:50.025" end="2:52.636" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.025" end="2:50.203">So</span> <span begin="2:50.203" end="2:50.386">we</span> <span begin="2:50.386" end="2:50.504">can</span> <span begin="2:50.504" end="2:50.927">see</span> <span begin="2:50.927" end="2:51.079">a</span> <span begin="2:51.079" end="2:51.390">brand</span> <span begin="2:51.390" end="2:51.627">new</span> <span begin="2:51.627" end="2:52.636">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星辰映衬出崭新世界</span></p><p begin="2:53.360" end="2:55.424" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.360" end="2:53.717">Step</span> <span begin="2:53.717" end="2:54.073">step</span> <span begin="2:54.073" end="2:54.260">walk</span><span begin="2:54.260" end="2:54.443">ing</span> <span begin="2:54.443" end="2:54.607">with</span> <span begin="2:54.607" end="2:55.424">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一步，两步，共同游于星光之下</span></p><p begin="2:55.625" end="2:58.222" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.625" end="2:55.816">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:55.816" end="2:55.981">be</span> <span begin="2:55.981" end="2:56.154">to</span><span begin="2:56.154" end="2:56.483">ge</span><span begin="2:56.483" end="2:56.670">ther</span> <span begin="2:56.670" end="2:56.926">for</span><span begin="2:56.926" end="2:57.044">e</span><span begin="2:57.044" end="2:58.222">ver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻不妨为永恒</span></p><p begin="2:58.947" end="3:01.028" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.947" end="2:59.289">Shine</span> <span begin="2:59.289" end="2:59.654">shine</span> <span begin="2:59.654" end="2:59.828">un</span><span begin="2:59.828" end="3:00.042">der</span> <span begin="3:00.042" end="3:00.152">the</span> <span begin="3:00.152" end="3:01.028">stars</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪亮，璀璨，比星光更甚</span></p><p begin="3:01.220" end="3:03.826" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.220" end="3:01.384">I</span><span begin="3:01.384" end="3:01.576">llu</span><span begin="3:01.576" end="3:01.717">mi</span><span begin="3:01.717" end="3:02.078">nate</span> <span begin="3:02.078" end="3:02.260">the</span> <span begin="3:02.260" end="3:02.580">dark</span><span begin="3:02.580" end="3:02.785">est</span> <span begin="3:02.785" end="3:03.826">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光辉甚至洒至所度过最漆黑的日子</span></p><p begin="3:04.524" end="3:06.614" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.524" end="3:04.884">I</span> <span begin="3:04.884" end="3:05.199">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:05.199" end="3:05.377">have</span> <span begin="3:05.377" end="3:05.546">to</span> <span begin="3:05.546" end="3:05.738">pre</span><span begin="3:05.738" end="3:06.614">tend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已无需假装</span></p><p begin="3:06.792" end="3:10.037" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.792" end="3:06.879">You</span><span begin="3:06.879" end="3:06.975">&apos;ll</span> <span begin="3:06.975" end="3:07.130">al</span><span begin="3:07.130" end="3:07.317">ways</span> <span begin="3:07.317" end="3:07.691">be</span> <span begin="3:07.691" end="3:07.855">here</span> <span begin="3:07.855" end="3:08.184">by</span> <span begin="3:08.184" end="3:08.307">my</span> <span begin="3:08.307" end="3:10.037">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直都于我身旁</span></p><p begin="3:10.041" end="3:19.743" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.041" end="3:10.260">(ha</span> <span begin="3:11.150" end="3:11.373">ha</span> <span begin="3:12.879" end="3